Bug 2081766 - Use a Set for RSS and Atom enclosure duplicate checks. r=tobyp

FeedParser checked each enclosure URL against an array of earlier URLs with
includes(), which made parsing quadratic in the number of enclosures in an item.

Differential Revision: https://phabricator.services.mozilla.com/D336251

